description: EA-2025-08-29-11 — Fix ICommandService signature and complete IService on UnitCommandService
 assets: DeepAbyssHive
 alwaysApply: true

PLAN
將 IsCommandAvailable 由唯讀改為 public bool { get; set; }（預設 true），以符合可能的 get; set; 需求。


補強 UnitCommandService 的 IService 實作為 get; set; 形式以提高相容性。


確保三個 partial 檔案與原類別同目錄（同 asmdef）以免 partial 失效。


CHANGES
1) BuildingConstructionService：修正 ICommandService
FIND_OR_CREATE_FILE: Assets/DeepAbyssHive/Buildings/Services/BuildingConstructionService.ICommandService.partial.cs
 <<<csharp
 using DeepAbyssHive.Core.Services;
namespace DeepAbyssHive.Buildings.Services
 {
 // 與 BuildingConstructionService 同命名空間/同目錄，確保同一 asmdef
 public partial class BuildingConstructionService : ICommandService
 {
 // 由唯讀改成可讀寫，滿足可能的 get; set; 介面要求
 public bool IsCommandAvailable { get; set; } = true;
 }
 }
2) UnitCommandService：完整實作 IService + ICommandService
FIND_OR_CREATE_FILE: Assets/DeepAbyssHive/Units/Services/UnitCommandService.IService.partial.cs
 <<<csharp
 using DeepAbyssHive.Core.Services;
namespace DeepAbyssHive.Units.Services
 {
 public partial class UnitCommandService : IService, ICommandService
 {
 // 若介面只要求 get;，get; set; 也能相容；若介面要求 set;，此版也可編
 public string ServiceName { get; set; } = nameof(UnitCommandService);
 public bool IsInitialized { get; private set; }
   public void Initialize()
    {
        IsInitialized = true;
    }

    public void Cleanup()
    {
        IsInitialized = false;
    }

    // 改為可讀寫屬性，預設 true；之後可改成依實際狀態判斷
    public bool IsCommandAvailable { get; set; } = true;
}

}
3) 確保主類宣告為 partial（若尚未）
